# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — never commit any of these. The pre-commit hook
# (.githooks/pre-commit) and the CI gitleaks step are a second
# line of defense; this file is the first.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All environment files (both real and example) stay local.
.env
.env.*
env.*
# Key / certificate material
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
secrets/
.secrets/
*.secret
# Common cloud keys
.aws/
.gcp/
.azure/
credentials.json
service-account*.json

